---
args: {"projects": "PlainLanguageProject[]", "units": "OperativeUnit[]", "guidance": "EvidenceItem[]"}
returns: "ReaderDecisionTask[]"
---
Identify the actual decisions and actions the intended readers need, using supplied audience/purpose guidance. Map every consequential unit to at least one reader task, including exceptional and prohibited actions. Separate missing background explanation from information that can be moved. Do not infer inability or preferences from demographic labels; preserve a question when audience needs are unknown.
